# The vendored CSS is emitted by the game (UiThemeTokens.ToCssVariables and
# VindicatorWebStyle.Components) and must stay byte-identical to what the
# in-game state server serves at /tokens.css and /components.css. With
# core.autocrlf on, a normal checkout would rewrite them to CRLF and break
# that contract, so pin them to LF on disk.
vindicator/tokens.css      text eol=lf
vindicator/components.css  text eol=lf
